                                "sense_id": "9bbca044-12bc-3b19-bd5e-46cada4eb6b6",
                                "text": "I'll just go to the lumberyard and buy some more two by fours so we can finish building this."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "90ffb699-c226-4b94-9d22-43ca617d2308",
                                "sense_id": "9bbca044-12bc-3b19-bd5e-46cada4eb6b6",
                                "text": "He got a job at the lumberyard, working the big saw for planks."
